{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1106","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Lunar New Year and Cross Counting"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lunar New Year is approaching, and you bought a matrix with lots of \"crosses\"."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This matrix $$$M$$$ of size $$$n \\times n$$$ contains only '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (without quotes). The element in the $$$i$$$-th row and the $$$j$$$-th column $$$(i, j)$$$ is defined as $$$M(i, j)$$$, where $$$1 \\leq i, j \\leq n$$$. We define a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cross"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" appearing in the $$$i$$$-th row and the $$$j$$$-th column ($$$1 \\lt i, j \\lt n$$$) if and only if $$$M(i, j) = M(i - 1, j - 1) = M(i - 1, j + 1) = M(i + 1, j - 1) = M(i + 1, j + 1) = $$$ '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following figure illustrates a cross appearing at position $$$(2, 2)$$$ in a $$$3 \\times 3$$$ matrix."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nX.X\n.X.\nX.X\n"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find out the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"crosses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the given matrix $$$M$$$. Two "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"crosses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are different if and only if they appear in different rows or columns."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains only one positive integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 500$$$), denoting the size of the matrix $$$M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$n$$$ lines illustrate the matrix $$$M$$$. Each line contains exactly $$$n$$$ characters, each of them is '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. The $$$j$$$-th element in the $$$i$$$-th line represents $$$M(i, j)$$$, where $$$1 \\leq i, j \\leq n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single line containing only one integer number $$$k$$$ — the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"crosses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the given matrix $$$M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n.....\n.XXX.\n.XXX.\n.XXX.\n.....\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_outpu